<p>SCP Article: Anomalous book can change the past and present and no one knows anything has changed except the book itself. Interesting events are recorded inside, how much of our past has been changed?</p>
<p><em>I moved and trimmed your thread summary, since it was taking up a lot of space in the main forum screen. Try to keep thread descriptions (the text in the little box under the thread title) short so you don't crowd out other authors in the forum listing. ~Zyn</em></p>
<p><strong>Seeking Greenlights:</strong><br />
Yes</p>
<p><strong>Page Type:</strong><br />
SCP Article</p>
<p><strong>Page Layout (Optional):</strong><br />
The Tests(not in the idea critique) can be cross referenced with the statements from the SCP to uncover what happened.<br />
Statements of |||||||||| is text that has been scratched out beyond recognition</p>
<p><strong>Elevator Pitch:</strong><br />
Dealing with retro-causality and how to test an anomalous object that can change the past.</p>
<ul>
<li>Testers have issues discovering how the SCP functions since it wipes peoples minds and rewrites history and records the instance of the change.</li>
</ul>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;show&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">–&nbsp;hide&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p><strong>Central Narrative:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Book was discovered to have been placed into SCP containment by someone who might have known the books anomalous properties.</li>
<li>Unfortunate Accident causes it to end up in the research department</li>
<li>Marion Wheeler discovers and returns the book back to containment.</li>
<li>Testing begins</li>
<li>Containment Breach by a D-Class individual using the book during a test.</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Hook/Attention-Grabber:</strong></p>
<p>Containment Summary-<br />
While within 5 meters of SCP-####. Do not speak or write any untrue statements. In an emergency you can talk in future tense but you must not make any statement about the past or present (specifically opinions or statements that are false or have the possibility of being false)</p>
<p>Description Summary:<br />
The text of SCP-#### is a range of statements about our world. More recent statements have been able to be verified as true. So far, no statements have been verified as false.</p>
<p>-Statements of probable significant interest from SCP -####</p>
<ul>
<li>Multiple Historic Statements</li>
<li>██████ has brought this book into a securely contained location under the protection of an organization that is currently trying to prevent its abuse in the future.</li>
<li>The research department is right around the corner from this SCP</li>
<li>I found the bug in your computer</li>
<li>██████ doesn't belong here, he is an idiot</li>
<li>You totally threw █████████ under the bus</li>
<li>I found the issue with the computer system</li>
<li>I am bringing SCP-#### back to its containment chamber</li>
<li>I brought SCP-#### back to its containment chamber on ██/██/19██ at 12:47 PM</li>
<li>The ceiling that contains this vault is colored blue</li>
<li>The ball is blue</li>
<li>████████ can speak Spanish</li>
<li>|||||||||||||||||||||||||||</li>
<li>██████ is color blind</li>
<li>████████ does not have cancer</li>
<li>||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||</li>
<li>[REDACTED]</li>
<li>-████████ can remember [REDACTED]</li>
<li>[REDACTED]</li>
<li>I have escaped this facility</li>
<li>████████ has been recaptured and securely contained as of ██/██/20██</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Additional Notes:</strong><br />
I wonder if the Test text will be understandable since test statements will be changed to match lines from the SCP. I have the tests written out but they are too many words for the idea critique</p>
